RULE a caller REGRESSES when geomean(default/tuned128 median ratio over taxi and Istella-S) > 1 + noise (the largest block-to-block spread of either arm's block medians on either dataset), or when a quality metric is WORSE; else it HOLDS. Every output hash must agree across arms and blocks (else IDENTITY-BREAK).
